# Code ownership for review routing on the protected branches (main, develop, 1.2.x).
# Teams: https://github.com/orgs/Cacti/teams
#
# Ownership only requests review automatically. It becomes a merge requirement
# once "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled on the branch ruleset, and
# each listed team must have write access for GitHub to accept it as an owner.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
